    "html": "<p>Four identical lamps are connected in a circuit. The current through lamp L is I.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The lamps are rearranged using the same cell.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_02\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 2\" src=\"asset:fig_02\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the current through L?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{I}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{I}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\">I</li><li data-label=\"D\">2I</li></ol>"
